cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Federated Time-Reference Observatory — Walking Skeleton (FTRO-WS-001)"
abstract: >-
  A federated catalogue and bitemporal reference-ancestry graph for public
  time-referenced measurements across pulsar timing, VLBI, GNSS and optical
  clock metrology. The observatory records identifiers, manifests, evidence,
  provenance and rights without taking custody of provider data. This
  repository implements the walking skeleton specified by task card
  FTRO-WS-001 v0.3.
type: dataset
